sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as Trails Frontend
    participant Service as Trails Service
    participant Grid as Selenium Hub
    participant Node as Browser Node
    participant Target as Application Under Test

    User->>Frontend: Start test execution
    Frontend->>Service: Submit execution request
    Service->>Grid: Request remote browser session
    Grid->>Node: Assign browser node
    Service->>Node: Execute browser actions
    Node->>Target: Open and operate target application
    Target-->>Node: Web pages, downloads, responses
    Node-->>Service: Results and managed downloads
    Service-->>Frontend: Execution result and diagnostics
    Frontend-->>User: Show status and artifacts
